{"articleNo":"236633","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=236633&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 2020 대구 발명아이디어 콘테스트 개최 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.04.20","hit":"5995","attachments":[{"name":"발명아이디어 콘테스트(2020)_200413_포스터 최종.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=236633&attachNo=87797"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">대구상공회의소 지식재산센터에서는 학생들의 발명동기 부여 및 참신한 아이디어 발굴</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">발명의식 고취와 저변 확대를 위해</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체;\">​ 『</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2020 </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">대구 발명아이디어 콘테스트</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체;\">』</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">를 아래와 같이 개최하오니 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">대회명칭</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체;\">『</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2020 </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">대구 발명아이디어 콘테스트</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체;\">』<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">접수기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: 4. 20(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) ~ 5. 17(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">참가자격</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">개인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">출품건수는 제한 없으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">공동 발명은 제출 불가함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">참가부문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">제한없음</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">생활 속 불편함을 개선한 아이디어부터 산업현장의 아이디어까지 모두 참여가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">문의처</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\">대구상공회의소 지식재산센터 </span><span l